      "source_url": "https://x.com/cknxnewstoday/status/2083212964623012294",
      "text": "Grey Bruce Public Health is warning drug users in the region that a toxic level of fentanyl has been found in a sample of local meth.\nhttps://cknxnewstoday.ca/midwestern/news/2026/07/31/health-unit-warns-of-toxic-level-of-fentanyl-in-local-meth-supply",
      "author_handle": "cknxnewstoday",
      "created_at": "2026-07-31T15:27:29Z",
      "has_media": false
    },
    {
      "source_url": "https://x.com/stoptheVOID/status/2081802131632439565",
      "text": "The latest report from the National Drug Early Warning System should concern every parent, educator and public-health professional.\n\nNDEWS recorded 16,335 suspected nonfatal overdose-related EMS encounters involving MDMA, commonly sold as Ecstasy or Molly, between January 1, 2023, and June 30, 2026.\n\nMore than half occurred in Southern states:\n\n• South: 8,955\n• West: 2,705\n• Midwest: 2,557\n• Northeast: 2,118\n\nBut the numbers tell only part of the story.\n\nNDEWS is also warning about counterfeit products, drugs sold as MDMA being mixed with other substances, and the possibility of illicit fentanyl appearing in this unpredictable supply.\n\nAs a father who lost my 16-year-old son Daniel to a counterfeit pill, I cannot say this strongly enough: you cannot trust the appearance, color, shape or name of an illicit pill. What someone believes is Molly or Ecstasy may contain something entirely different, and one pill can be enough to cause irreversible harm or even death.\n\nWe must keep educating young people with honest, current information. The illicit drug supply continues to change, and our prevention efforts must change with it.\n\nSource: National Drug Early Warning System, Weekly Briefing Issue 294, July 24, 2026.\n\nFollow us at: https://t.co/5nGORkNczU\n\n@DEAHQ \n@TheJusticeDept \n@samhsagov \n@ONDCP \n@DHSgov \n\n#NewsAlert #CounterfeitPills #fentanylawareness #drugpreventionandeducation\n #PublicSafety #stoptheVOID",
      "author_handle": "stoptheVOID",
      "created_at": "2026-07-27T18:01:20Z",
      "has_media": true
    },
    {
      "source_url": "https://x.com/aud7misner/status/2083275541877252247",
      "text": "How a rural Utah community hit hard by overdose deaths is responding to fentanyl https://www.fox13now.com/fentanyl/how-a-rural-utah-community-hit-hard-by-overdose-deaths-is-responding-to-fentanyl",
      "author_handle": "aud7misner",
